{
  "transcript": {
    "duration": 354.38,
    "segments": [
      {
        "id": 0,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 0.0,
        "end": 2.2,
        "text": "Good evening; what are you looking for today?"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 3.7,
        "end": 13.600000000000001,
        "text": "I called about the fourteen inch laptop with sixteen gb ram. You quoted forty two thousand nine hundred ninety. Is it available?"
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 14.750000000000002,
        "end": 19.3,
        "text": "Yes! we have it in silver-same configuration and the same price."
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 20.2,
        "end": 21.45,
        "text": "Shall I bring a sealed piece?"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 22.8,
        "end": 26.249999999999996,
        "text": "Yes, please, the charger is included, right?"
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 27.502,
        "end": 36.352,
        "text": "Yes, the original charger is inside the box. With this laptop you can also take a wireless mouse and a padded sleeve together for nine hundred ninety nine rupees."
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 37.152,
        "end": 40.652,
        "text": "Separately those two come to one thousand four hundred ninety eight rupees."
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 41.402,
        "end": 43.302,
        "text": "I wasn't planning on accessories."
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 44.102000000000004,
        "end": 45.501999999999995,
        "text": "Can I see the sleeve first?"
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 46.872,
        "end": 52.972,
        "text": "Of course here it is: this size fits the fourteen inch model and there's a small pocket in front."
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 53.372,
        "end": 56.772,
        "text": "Ah, and the mouse works with a u s b receiver?"
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 57.772,
        "end": 64.172,
        "text": "Yes; the receiver is stored under the battery cover; one double a battery is included."
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 65.372,
        "end": 72.472,
        "text": "Okay, add both for nine hundred ninety nine rupees; the sleeve will be useful for my office commute."
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 73.724,
        "end": 81.124,
        "text": "Done.--Laptop plus the mouse and sleeve bundle comes to forty three thousand nine hundred eighty nine rupees, including g s t"
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 82.324,
        "end": 87.024,
        "text": "Fine; I'll pay by card. Please put my name on the invoice."
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 88.824,
        "end": 93.824,
        "text": "Certainly; please give me your name and we'll check the laptop together after billing."
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 95.0,
        "end": 100.75,
        "text": "It's Rahul Mehta. Yes, I'd like to check it before leaving."
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 109.05000000000001,
        "end": 111.65,
        "text": "Good evening. What are you looking for today?"
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 112.65,
        "end": 120.10000000000001,
        "text": "I need a laptop for office work, mostly Excel, emails and video calls, around forty five thousand."
      },
      {
        "id": 19,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 121.39,
        "end": 132.49,
        "text": "This one is forty two thousand nine hundred ninety rupees, with eight gigabytes RAM and a five hundred twelve gigabytes s s d It will handle that work. Please try the keyboard."
      },
      {
        "id": 20,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 133.54,
        "end": 141.24,
        "text": "Keyboard feels fine. I usually have quite a few sheets open during calls though. My current laptop hangs then."
      },
      {
        "id": 21,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 143.09,
        "end": 146.04,
        "text": "For that I would suggest considering this premium model."
      },
      {
        "id": 22,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 146.932,
        "end": 160.28199999999998,
        "text": "It has sixteen gigabytes ram, a newer processor, and a brighter screen. It is above your budget, but the extra memory should help when you have everything open together. How much above? I don't want the budget to keep going up."
      },
      {
        "id": 23,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 162.682,
        "end": 174.082,
        "text": "It is forty nine thousand nine hundred ninety including g s t, so seven thousand more than the first laptop, and four thousand nine hundred ninety dollars above the budget you mentioned."
      },
      {
        "id": 24,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 175.214,
        "end": 181.464,
        "text": "Hmm! Let me think; I use every day, and I don't want the same hanging problem again."
      },
      {
        "id": 25,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 182.314,
        "end": 185.414,
        "text": "All right, I'll take the sixteen gigabyte model."
      },
      {
        "id": 26,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 186.264,
        "end": 201.714,
        "text": "Sure, one optional addition before I make the bill-two years of extended warranty-is three thousand four hundred ninety nine rupees. That starts after the included one year warranty, and covers mechanical and electrical failures under the plan terms."
      },
      {
        "id": 27,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 203.214,
        "end": 210.614,
        "text": "Another three and a half thousand; does that cover a broken screen also, or only faults in the laptop?"
      },
      {
        "id": 28,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 211.614,
        "end": 225.91400000000002,
        "text": "Only covered faults; accidental screen damage, liquid damage and normal battery wear are excluded; here are the written terms, you can check them before deciding; with the warranty, your total would be fifty three thousand four hundred eighty nine rupees."
      },
      {
        "id": 29,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 226.66400000000002,
        "end": 237.346,
        "text": "Let me read that once. OK-I understand the exclusions; I'm planning to keep this for at least four years, so, yes, add the extended warranty."
      },
      {
        "id": 30,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 238.446,
        "end": 249.946,
        "text": "Done-The sixteen gb laptop and the two year extension come to fifty three thousand four hundred eighty nine rupees. I'll put the warranty details on the invoice as well-card or up i"
      },
      {
        "id": 31,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 251.246,
        "end": 252.496,
        "text": "Card, please."
      },
      {
        "id": 32,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 253.404,
        "end": 257.354,
        "text": "And please email me the invoice and warranty document."
      },
      {
        "id": 33,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 266.30400000000003,
        "end": 272.05400000000003,
        "text": "ارے بہار ابھی بھی بارش ہو رہی ہے کیا؟"
      },
      {
        "id": 34,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 272.30400000000003,
        "end": 277.80400000000003,
        "text": "haan; halki ho gayi hai ab; das minute to saamne shed ke neeche khada tha."
      },
      {
        "id": 35,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 278.58,
        "end": 282.63,
        "text": "yahan enjans pe bhi paani aa gaya tha, اچھا کیا۔ abhi saaf kiya hai."
      },
      {
        "id": 36,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 283.58,
        "end": 286.53,
        "text": "haan, aaj to achanak hi shuru ho gayi!"
      },
      {
        "id": 37,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 287.63,
        "end": 290.47999999999996,
        "text": "bilkul bataiye, kya chahiye tha."
      },
      {
        "id": 38,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 291.72999999999996,
        "end": 295.43,
        "text": "ek simple wired mouse chahiye, laptop ke liye,"
      },
      {
        "id": 39,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 296.53,
        "end": 298.78,
        "text": "paanch sau ke andar."
      },
      {
        "id": 40,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 300.18,
        "end": 305.914,
        "text": "yeh wala chaar so chhiyali ka hai. normal u sb port hai na aapke laptop mein"
      },
      {
        "id": 41,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 306.414,
        "end": 309.614,
        "text": "haan, hai, ek baar chala ke dikha do bas."
      },
      {
        "id": 42,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 310.464,
        "end": 318.664,
        "text": "ji, is demo laptop pe laga deta hoon ye dekhiye, click aur scroll dono check kar lijiye"
      },
      {
        "id": 43,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 319.364,
        "end": 323.164,
        "text": "haan, theek chal raha hai, yahi pack kar do."
      },
      {
        "id": 44,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 324.114,
        "end": 328.314,
        "text": "iske saath mouse pad bhi chahiye basic wala nau nau ka hai"
      },
      {
        "id": 45,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 328.884,
        "end": 332.73400000000004,
        "text": "nahi, mouse pad ghar pe hai. sirf mouse dedo."
      },
      {
        "id": 46,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 333.584,
        "end": 340.784,
        "text": "haan ji, ye qr hai. total chaar so nabbe. mouse aur bill is bag mein rakh diye hain."
      },
      {
        "id": 47,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 341.98400000000004,
        "end": 345.334,
        "text": "ho gaya payment dekho-theek hai, thank u."
      }
    ],
